function setAnaliseBidEmb(emb,v){ var x=parseFloat(String(v).replace(',','.')); if(v===''||isNaN(x)){ delete analiseBidMap[emb]; } else { analiseBidMap[emb]=x; } renderAnalise(); }
function setAnaliseRowLimit(v){ var x=parseInt(String(v),10); analiseRowLimit=(isNaN(x)||x<1)?25:x; renderAnalise(); }
function setAnaliseSort(v){ analiseSort=v||'rep'; renderAnalise(); }
function setAnaliseShowTrendCols(v){ analiseShowTrendCols=!!v; renderAnalise(); }
  function cycleAnaliseBasisCols(){ var o=['both','fob','cfr','off']; var i=o.indexOf(analiseBasisCols); analiseBasisCols=o[(i<0?0:i+1)%o.length]; renderAnalise(); }
  function analiseBasisLabel(){ return {both:'Basis: FOB + margem', fob:'Basis: só FOB', cfr:'Basis: só margem', off:'Basis: OFF'}[analiseBasisCols]||'Basis: FOB + margem'; }
function setAnaliseDeskView(v){ analiseDeskView=(v==='tab'?'tab':'classic'); renderAnalise(); }
